KuGouMusicApi (vendored)
=======================

This directory is a vendored snapshot of the KuGouMusicApi project,
used by AstraMusic as the local API sidecar.

    Upstream : https://github.com/MakcRe/KuGouMusicApi
    Version  : 1.6.2
    License  : MIT (see LICENSE in this directory)
    Copyright: (c) 2023 MakcRe

No source files were modified. When vendoring, the upstream `.git` and
`.github` directories were removed; everything else is upstream as-is.

AstraMusic talks to this sidecar over HTTP (default http://127.0.0.1:6521)
and does not link against or embed its code.
